{% doc %}
  What a shopper should know before they pay, said once for both the cart
  page and the cart drawer so the two can never disagree.

  ── Every line here is a promise made elsewhere ─────────────────────────
  - Free delivery progress lives in sv-cart-ship (the banner at the top
    of the summary), not here.
  - Delivery rates: Settings → Shipping and delivery → General profile
    (Kerala 80, South India 150, Rest 200, Remote 200; all free ≥ 2,000 —
    threshold from shop.metafields.custom.free_shipping_threshold).
  - GST: Settings → Taxes → India, 5% on every state (prices tax-inclusive).
    Change both lines here the day either setting changes.
  - Payment: Settings → Payments — Cashfree (UPI first, then credit and
    debit cards, netbanking, wallets), prepaid only, no Cash on Delivery. Change this line the day
    the gateway or COD position changes.
  - Returns: never restated here. sv-returns-line owns that wording, and
    its copy speaks from the product page ("measurements are on this
    page"), so the cart links to the published policy instead.

  @param {string} [context] - 'page' (default) or 'drawer'

  @example
  {% render 'sv-cart-notes', context: 'drawer' %}
{% enddoc %}

{%- liquid
  assign context = context | default: 'page'
  assign wa_text = 'Hi, I have a question about my bag before I pay.' | url_encode
-%}

<div class="sv-cart-notes sv-cart-notes--{{ context }}">
  <dl class="sv-cart-notes__facts">
    <div>
      <dt>Delivery</dt>
      <dd>
        Kerala ₹80 &middot; South India ₹150 &middot; rest of India and remote areas ₹200. Free on orders over {{ shop.metafields.custom.free_shipping_threshold.value | default: 200000 | money_without_trailing_zeros }}.
        Your exact charge shows at checkout.
      </dd>
    </div>
    <div>
      <dt>GST</dt>
      <dd>Prices include 5% GST</dd>
    </div>
    <div>
      <dt>Payment</dt>
      <dd>Prepaid &middot; UPI, credit &amp; debit cards, netbanking &amp; wallets, secured by Cashfree</dd>
    </div>
    <div>
      <dt>Dispatch</dt>
      <dd>Packed and handed to the courier within 1&ndash;2 working days</dd>
    </div>
  </dl>

  <a class="sv-cart-notes__policy" href="{{ shop.refund_policy.url | default: '/policies/refund-policy' }}">Returns &amp; claims policy</a>

  <a
    class="sv-cart-notes__wa"
    href="https://wa.me/918547629251?text={{ wa_text }}"
    target="_blank"
    rel="noopener"
  >
    {%- render 'sv-icon', name: 'whatsapp' -%}
    <span>Questions before you pay? WhatsApp us</span>
  </a>
</div>
